title: Oversight for Delivery
subtitle: Trade opposition votes for one enforceable clause, audit and deadline.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_negotiation_card
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_oversight_bargain_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_oversight_bargain_timer = 3
card-image: img/poland/deck_parliament.svg

= Oversight for delivery

**Cabinet:** [+ government_name +]. **Lewica:** [+ left_role +].

A committee vote is approaching. Lewica can offer limited support for a
published implementation clause. This is ordinary opposition bargaining: it
does not transfer budget authority or make the party responsible for the
cabinet's whole programme.

Base leverage **[+ negotiation_leverage +]** · hostility **[+
government_negotiation_hostility +]**.

- @audit
- @amendment
- @expose

@audit
title: Offer abstention for an audit, deadline and beneficiary register
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource · score +8 · success at 50 under PiS, 42 otherwise.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Line-by-line drafting and monitoring require one resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.negotiation_attempts += 1;
Q.negotiation_last_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.negotiation_leverage) || 0) + 8
);
Q.negotiation_last_threshold =
    Q.government_party == "pis" ? 50 : 42;
Q.negotiation_success =
    Q.negotiation_last_score >= Q.negotiation_last_threshold ? 1 : 0;
Q.negotiation_last_result = Q.negotiation_success
    ? "Audit-for-abstention bargain accepted"
    : "Audit-for-abstention bargain refused";
if (Q.negotiation_success) {
    Q.negotiation_successes += 1;
    Q.negotiation_capital += 2;
    Q.government_procedural_restraint += 4;
    Q.public_trust += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 2;
    Q.judicial_legitimacy += 1;
    Q.pis_relation += Q.government_party == "pis" ? 2 : 0;
    Q.ko_relation += Q.government_party == "ko" ? 2 : 0;
    Q.news_headline =
        "An opposition audit clause buys a conditional abstention";
} else {
    Q.negotiation_capital -= 1;
    Q.media_capacity += 1;
    Q.public_trust += 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet refuses an audit rather than purchase an abstention";
}
!}
go-to: result

@amendment
title: Offer votes only for a named labour or service amendment
subtitle: Score +4 · lower reward, same public threshold: 46 under PiS, 38 otherwise.
on-arrival: {!
Q.negotiation_attempts += 1;
Q.negotiation_last_score = Math.round(
    (Number(Q.negotiation_leverage) || 0) + 4
);
Q.negotiation_last_threshold =
    Q.government_party == "pis" ? 46 : 38;
Q.negotiation_success =
    Q.negotiation_last_score >= Q.negotiation_last_threshold ? 1 : 0;
Q.negotiation_last_result = Q.negotiation_success
    ? "Single implementation amendment accepted"
    : "Single implementation amendment refused";
if (Q.negotiation_success) {
    Q.negotiation_successes += 1;
    Q.negotiation_capital += 1;
    Q.labor_credibility += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 1;
    Q.industrial_logistics_left_affinity += 2;
    Q.public_service_families_left_affinity += 2;
    Q.public_trust += 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "One enforceable opposition amendment enters the government bill";
} else {
    Q.negotiation_capital -= 1;
    Q.public_trust -= 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The cabinet rejects even a single opposition implementation clause";
}
!}
go-to: result

@expose
title: Withhold support and make the committee hearing the whole strategy
subtitle: No bargain · +3 media · -2 government relation · no delivery gain.
on-arrival: negotiation_success = 0; negotiation_last_result = "No bargain — public scrutiny only"; negotiation_last_score = negotiation_leverage; negotiation_last_threshold = 50 if government_party = "pis"; negotiation_last_threshold = 42 if government_party != "pis"; media_capacity += 3; public_trust += 1; pis_relation -= 2; ko_relation -= 2; government_delivery -= 1; news_headline = "The hearing exposes the bill and changes none of its clauses"
go-to: result

@result
title: The committee price
new-page: true

**[+ negotiation_last_result +]**  
Score **[+ negotiation_last_score +]** · required **[+
negotiation_last_threshold +]**.

[? if negotiation_success: The concession is written into the measure. Lewica
can claim the clause; the cabinet still owns the bill and its implementation.?]
[? if not negotiation_success: Scrutiny can create a later electoral cost. It
does not create the clause that the cabinet refused today.?]

- #poland_card_finish
